# X0: status of the four-card set, an all-four reset with the heal (X1 opens all four cards next and must start from freshly
# trained boards), then build the tp4-exact image. Run first: it is the cheapest job and the only one every later job depends on.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the four-card exactness window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it):
# copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/exact and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here
# names a rig, a card or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. No placeholder is left to fill: this window runs no
# one-card harness and needs no graft binary.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG names the image X0 builds from this same commit; a later commit needs a new tag.
# Duration (estimate, wall clock): status 1-2 min; reset and heal 3-6 min (up to 12); build 7-15 min when the image layers are
# cached (the bundle stage is; only the overlay and the profiles are new), 30-70 min cold (step limit 75). It runs the image
# copy-closure and overlay tests inside the P8 base first, then G1 provenance, and tags the image only if they pass, so a closure
# error fails here with no card touched.
# NO graft .so is involved: the change is host Python (tile_collective_tp.py, the model_batch scope, the tp_addresses.install hook),
# shipped through the overlay list, the fast-serving Dockerfile copy list and the image workflow's loop, all three.
# Stop rule: any failed step.
# Read: the status listing (four boards by id, one firmware bundle on all of them, at least four free 1 GiB hugepages, no holders,
# NO platform serving container, disk for a new ~32 GB image), then the build log (closure tests OK, provenance passed, and
# tile_collective_tp.py in the overlay listing).
# Proves: the image carries the new module. A file in one copy list only would ship the old bundle, the fix would be absent, and
# tp_addresses.install would fail at attach on the missing import.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=status reset build
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-exact-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-gate
